      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend 2 1/2 cups sweetener, melted butter, and almond extract together in a bowl. Press crust mixture into an ungreased 9x13-inch pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake crust in the preheated oven for 15 to 20 minutes. Remove from oven and leave oven on. Cool crust for 10 minutes.",
